  "description": "Preview. Migrates a NUKE 8+ build to Tamp (ADR 0021); run it as `tamp migrate nuke`. A syntactic Roslyn rewrite that applies the auto-tier rows of the NUKE-to-Tamp mapping, leaves a // TAMP-MIGRATE(rule-id) marker at every site it won't touch, and writes a coverage report. It never compiles or restores the NUKE build.",
